{{Quote|What is in the Sertar sector?''"<br />"''That's where Florrum is.''"<br />"''You've been there? What can we expect?''"<br />"''Pirates.|[[Adi Gallia]] and [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]]|<ref name="Revival" />}}
The '''Sertar sector''' was a sector<ref name="Revival" /> located in the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Florrum DB" /> It contained the [[planet]] [[Florrum]], home of [[Hondo Ohnaka]]'s [[Ohnaka Gang|gang]] of [[pirate]]s.<ref name="Revival" /> [[Syngia Station]] was based in the Sertar sector.<ref name="secret">''[[Servants of the Empire: The Secret Academy]]''</ref>

